{"server":"tw","storyId":"act16side_level_act16side_04_end","groupId":"act16side","stageId":"act16side_04","title":"安魂教堂","storyCode":"GA-4","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act16side/level_act16side_04_end.txt","sourceHash":"a3adaeef4e36bdd2c4a33d92708980df48904eb7cdc70d8d63df85df7c12e610","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g6_laterano_chapelin"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再多和我講些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呀，小心手上的蠟燭，別燙著！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！不能捏壞形狀......不然就不好看了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"為了媽媽......我要做得完美一點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好啦，我講得已經夠多的了。無非是無聊的冒險，尋常的生活。至於傳說中的卡茲戴爾......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說來慚愧，我們都沒有去過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"薩卡茲的卡茲戴爾......一定就像薩科塔的拉特蘭一樣吧！是薩卡茲們的家鄉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每個人都開開心心的，也會有棉花糖車吧？還有點心店......大街上會有好多高高興興的薩卡茲，大家互相打招呼！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......也許是吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終有一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"該說說你了，塞茜莉亞。你的爸爸媽媽是什麼樣的人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實，我也不太清楚......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我見到爸爸的次數很少......每次要見爸爸的時候，媽媽就會準備很久，帶著我在晚上出門，走很遠很遠......走到樹林裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在森林裡見面，爸爸總是穿著厚厚的斗篷，似乎剛從遙遠的地方趕過來......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我其實不太記得爸爸的長相，但我記得爸爸的角！漆黑又筆直，在月亮下閃閃發光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他會牽著我的手在樹林的邊緣散步，告訴我每一棵樹的種類和年齡......城外的晚上好安靜，連羽獸的叫聲都沒有，但我一點也不怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸老是緊緊牽著我的手，其實會有一點點疼......但我不想告訴他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"每次見到爸爸，我覺得爸爸比我還要高興......！好像也有點......緊張？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我走累了，媽媽就會背著我回家。我回頭，就會看到爸爸站在高高的樹下面，一直看著我們，走了很遠很遠，他還站在那裡......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的爸爸媽媽都是了不起的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我覺得媽媽可厲害了！她什麼都會！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，你看，這是媽媽的守護銃，艾澤爾哥哥放在我這裡了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽說，爸爸根本打不過她......她都是讓著爸爸呢！不過我想爸爸也應該很厲害，嗯！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈塞茜莉亞，我說的“了不起”和你說的“厲害”，可能不是同一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎？那爸爸媽媽一定又了不起又厲害！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過，媽媽從來不和我講她和爸爸認識的故事，我每次想問，稀裡糊塗地就被媽媽繞去說別的了......為什麼媽媽不告訴我呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......當我們還小的時候啊，更重要的事情還有很多。你喜歡看泡茶嗎，我小時候可喜歡看泡茶啦，茶水的顏色一層一層地變化......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......羅塞菈姐姐，你現在繞開話題的樣子，和媽媽就很像哦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......其實我也不是什麼都不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"昨天我在城裡跑了好多地方，除了你，一個薩卡茲都沒見到......薩卡茲，不能來拉特蘭，是不是？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以爸爸和媽媽也不應該在一起......不對，我是想說，是不是有人不讓爸爸媽媽在一起？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，沒有什麼不應該在一起......這些一定會改變的。不會很久......總有一天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相愛沒有罪過。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們就是為此來到這裡的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"到了那一天，我也可以在拉特蘭的大街上隨便亂逛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"當然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再也不用偷偷藏在房間裡？那拉特蘭每一家糖果店我都可以去一次嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一次哪裡夠呀，塞茜莉亞喜歡去多少次就去多少次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗚......真希望那一天快點來......好想快點長大！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是啊，如果你快快長大，也許......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，塞茜莉亞，我們不用那麼著急。我小時候，總覺得等長大了，什麼煩惱都可以解決掉。可是，等到真的長大了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"長大是一件非常非常非常辛苦的事，塞茜莉亞，對你來說更是這樣，你肩負著......不，算了。你還小，別去想這些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可每個人都會長大呀？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，我們沒有選擇。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一直微笑著的羅塞菈露出了有些落寞的神情。\n她看向小教堂的窗外，外面是開滿鮮花的墓園，再遠處，隱約可見高踞於拉特蘭城中心的聖像。\n她輕輕哼起了歌。憂傷，又依稀帶著希望。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，是這首歌！昨天碰到羅塞菈姐姐的時候......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽教我這首歌的時候說，歌詞她記不清楚了，就用啦啦啦代替了。可是曲調真的好好聽......本來的歌詞，是講什麼的呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是薩卡茲的歌，歌詞講的是一個英雄，他要出發去做了不起的事情啦，人們就唱歌和他告別，送他啟程，願他平安歸來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歌裡面唱啊，英雄就要出發啦，沿著通往遠方的路，去實現他的夢想......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也許路途遙遠，但一定，一定......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，修士先生！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在聊什麼呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"先導，日安——都是些有的沒的，薩卡茲以前的故事啦，再說說家常話......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可有意思了......我從來沒和人聊過這麼多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"艾澤爾哥哥，這是你摘的花嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是，我想，也許可以萃取一下，給蠟燭加上香味......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"香氣可以指引離去之人的方向。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，謝謝艾澤爾哥哥！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......艾澤爾哥哥，其實......我其實......有點害怕。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"葬禮......和媽媽道別......就是真的最後一次道別了，對嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真的再也不能見了？就算過節也不行嗎？或者......和爸爸一樣，很久見一次......是不是也不行？就算......只是摸摸頭也不行......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算......就算......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塞茜莉亞","speakerId":"avg_npc_352_1","isRemote":false,"text":"媽媽......還有一個天使和馱獸的故事，沒有講完......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是最後一晚了，塞茜莉亞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"羅塞菈","speakerId":"avg_npc_363_1","isRemote":false,"text":"塞茜莉亞，今天晚上，我陪你待在媽媽的房間吧，我們都會陪你。你們不會孤獨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"艾澤爾","speakerId":"avg_4036_forcer_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......薩卡茲為一對薩科塔母女守夜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_351_1","isRemote":false,"text":"燭火雖弱，亦能照亮彼岸。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g7_laterano_ward"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，我們又來看你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"給你帶了點甜點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"從大教堂拿出來的水果塔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎。順便一提，上面的仙人掌看起來很難吃。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不愧是你，蕾繆安，眼神真好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"說起來，你們有這麼想我，到了要每天來看我一次的程度？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你要是需要，我們每個小時來看你也可以啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，你在獻殷勤嗎？至於菲亞梅塔......笑得很勉強哦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出事了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你遇到他了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭混進了薩卡茲，而我在追捕薩卡茲的時候......正面撞上了他的源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是嗎，沒受傷就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，你在這裡沒問題嗎？畢竟只是普通醫院，萬一......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他已經來過了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說什——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......唉。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"病房中一時寂靜。\n蕾繆安看向桌上的瓶花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們說起他的態度，簡直就像在談論周末的野餐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，我不想和你生氣......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但唯獨在這件事上......無論是你，還是莫斯提馬，每一次，每一次，我提起那時的事情，你們就會露出一樣的表情......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看到你們的樣子，我會覺得......好像那天發瘋的人不是他，而是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我們只是感受到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"又是你們薩科塔那一套？好，你感受到了，那你又為什麼向他舉銃？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兩回事。不論他當時有多......我也不可能讓他奪走鎖與匙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那之後呢？他害得你墮天了......！你就這樣無所謂？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾繆安，他的源石技藝，把你傷成這樣，在病床上昏迷了五年......你也無所謂嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，我們是與你一邊的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是，我確實能感受......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我不想再聽到這個詞。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們是不是覺得，我的生氣很多餘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會呢，菲亞梅塔，我明白......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對的，當然了，你們都明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只有我不明白。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喂，菲亞梅塔！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾繆安","speakerId":"avg_npc_353_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唉......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g11_laterano_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲亞梅塔，菲亞梅塔！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"微光守夜人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"揍你啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你聽我說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提馬，我告訴你！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_i05"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"聽好了，我再也受不了你們這些混蛋薩科塔了！什麼共感，什麼互相理解！我根本就不想懂！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"光環是把你們這些天使的腦子燒壞了嗎？你和蕾繆安，差點死在那片廢墟裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們為什麼不生氣？你們為什麼不憤怒？為什麼只有我......我的憤怒格格不入？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"別再給我擺那種故作高深的笑臉，說起什麼都無所謂的態度！你不得不離開拉特蘭，到處奔波，風餐露宿，居無定所，是拜誰所賜？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一路跟著你到維多利亞，到萊塔尼亞，到薩爾貢，到炎國......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你以為到底是為了什麼？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你，蕾繆安，安多恩......我們的小隊。我們有過那麼......相互信任的時候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他有什麼了不得的苦衷？他憑什麼背叛這些信任？你們憑什麼要理解他？我又為什麼要理解他！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道我有多捨不得那段日子......？每一次有驚無險地完成任務......每一次蕾繆安帶我們去喝酒......每一次我們去試新開的甜品店......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"甚至每一次他幫大家改報告......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他有什麼理由，就隨手毀了這一切......？！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的日子......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那樣的日子，我是在乎的啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是嗎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"拉特蘭的鳶尾花。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只長在聖瑪律索中心花園、夕輝禮拜堂和司提望區安魂教堂這幾個地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走吧，我們一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提馬","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你可是我的監視者，可別讓我受傷了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亞梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
